--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFD: closed bound of the fine Prop. 11 cost*: `ilCostF_le_coeff`: `ilCostF j V ≤ (V + W^j)·G_j + (Kb + S·Kd)·(S+1)^j·(Bb+2)²` with
--   `G_{j+1} = (S/W) G_j + K(q+1)` (no `(Bb+2)²` factor on the volume term).
--   `ilCostF_le`: when `S/W < m^τ`,
--   `ilCostF j V ≤ K₀ (V + W^j) (m^j)^τ + (Kb + S·Kd)(S+1)^j (Bb+2)²`.
--   The second term is the per-call overhead: `(S+1)^j` bounds the number of calls of the recursion,
